  "goodToKnow": "Zuwider means repugnant to: Das ist mir zuwider (I can't stand it). It also means contrary to, after a dative noun: dem Gesetz zuwider. Zuwiderlaufen means to run counter to, and zuwiderhandeln to contravene: Zuwiderhandlungen werden bestraft (violations will be prosecuted) appears on many German signs. It's formal or a bit old-fashioned."
